      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.UI.Popups.PausePopup.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Pause popup UI that handles pause menu interactions as an overlay
Provides options to resume, load game, access options, or return to main menu
Works within PlayingState rather than as a separate state</p>
